      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This makes sense. Prioritize avatars at a very close range then load everyone else. I would image there could be an internal query system where people's avatars are loaded on a list and the list can prioritize by proximity then by optimization; optimization meaning prioritizing the most optimized avatars first and then load avatars that are more unoptimized.",
      "viewerReactions": null
