      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Sounds difficult to implement as people are always moving. Example: You spawn in at spawn point then avatars around spawnpoint start loading, you run over to your friends only to find that your friends avatars aren't loading, instead the people around spawnpoint are loading. Might be easier just to add a feature where you can select a user and click a \"prioritize load\" button or something.",
      "viewerReactions": null
