  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I think it would be useful to load in avatars first, who are standing closer to your point of view. There is a higher priority for them to be visible since you might be talking to them first. At the end the main idea is that around your own point of view there's a priority radius loading in people who are closer faster than those who are further away.",
